{"content_hash": "c15e8f94c03cd618", "version_id": 914, "article_id": 92, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "MOUZ sweeps to IEM Beijing 2026 title, BLAST Hong Kong next", "title_zh": "MOUZ 横扫夺冠 IEM 北京 2026，BLAST 香港站本周开打", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/024/041.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589100957915-44c9c9228464?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8bW91eiUyMGllbSUyMG1ham9yfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQxODYzNDR8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by wu yi on Unsplash", "author": "wu yi", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@takeshi2?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/black-and-white-bluetooth-earphones-vsCK6oPj5KY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(92, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(130, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "767cdf81a8f4"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-09", "word_count": 158, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "MOUZ won the IEM Beijing 2026 CS2 tournament without losing a single match, beating Mongolz 3-0 in the final. The team now heads to BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong, the last big event before the PGL Major Singapore.", "lead_zh": "MOUZ 在 IEM 北京 2026 的《CS2》比赛中一场未败，决赛 3-0 横扫 Mongolz 夺冠。接下来各队将转战 BLAST 香港站，这是 PGL 新加坡 Major 前的最后一场大型赛事。", "preview": "The IEM Beijing 2026 CS2 tournament ended on Sunday, with MOUZ lifting the trophy after a dominant 3-0 victory over Mongolz in the final. MO", "preview_zh": "IEM 北京 2026《CS2》赛事于周日落幕，MOUZ 在决赛中 3-0 横扫 Mongolz，捧起冠军奖杯。MOUZ 在整个赛事中一场未败，这凸显了他们在下一项大赛前的强劲状态。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 897, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 60.725, "size_bytes": 365328, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 181, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 62.375, "size_bytes": 375264, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 181, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 66.525, "size_bytes": 400176, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 181, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 57.575, "size_bytes": 346464, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 181, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 61.85, "size_bytes": 372096, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 181, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fa23f15/content/data/versions/914.json", "paragraphs": ["The IEM Beijing 2026 CS2 tournament ended on Sunday, with MOUZ lifting the trophy after a dominant 3-0 victory over Mongolz in the final. MOUZ did not lose a single match throughout the event, which underlines their strong form ahead of the next major competition.", "In the third-place match, NAVI defeated BB 2-0 to finish third. The Chinese team TYLOO ended the tournament in 9th to 12th place, which shows there is still a gap between them and the top international sides.", "Attention now turns to BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026, which will be held from 11 to 15 November. This event is seen as the final chance for top CS2 teams to practise and test their strategies before the PGL Major Singapore 2026.", "With the Major approaching, every match in Hong Kong will matter. Teams will be looking to build momentum and fix any weaknesses exposed in Beijing, while fans can expect a highly competitive tournament."], "paragraphs_zh": ["IEM 北京 2026《CS2》赛事于周日落幕，MOUZ 在决赛中 3-0 横扫 Mongolz，捧起冠军奖杯。MOUZ 在整个赛事中一场未败，这凸显了他们在下一项大赛前的强劲状态。", "季军赛中，NAVI 以 2-0 战胜 BB，获得第三名。中国战队 TYLOO 最终排名第 9 至 12 位，这说明他们与国际顶尖强队之间仍有差距。", "接下来，各队将目光转向 BLAST Premier Rivals 香港 2026，比赛将于 11 月 11 日至 15 日举行。该赛事被视为顶尖《CS2》战队在 PGL 新加坡 Major 2026 前最后的练兵和战术测试机会。", "随着 Major 临近，香港站的每场比赛都至关重要。各队将力争积累势头，并解决在北京暴露出的问题，而粉丝们可以期待一场竞争激烈的赛事。"], "body": "The IEM Beijing 2026 CS2 tournament ended on Sunday, with MOUZ lifting the trophy after a dominant 3-0 victory over Mongolz in the final. MOUZ did not lose a single match throughout the event, which underlines their strong form ahead of the next major competition.\n\nIn the third-place match, NAVI defeated BB 2-0 to finish third. The Chinese team TYLOO ended the tournament in 9th to 12th place, which shows there is still a gap between them and the top international sides.\n\nAttention now turns to BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026, which will be held from 11 to 15 November. This event is seen as the final chance for top CS2 teams to practise and test their strategies before the PGL Major Singapore 2026.\n\nWith the Major approaching, every match in Hong Kong will matter. Teams will be looking to build momentum and fix any weaknesses exposed in Beijing, while fans can expect a highly competitive tournament.", "body_zh": "IEM 北京 2026《CS2》赛事于周日落幕，MOUZ 在决赛中 3-0 横扫 Mongolz，捧起冠军奖杯。MOUZ 在整个赛事中一场未败，这凸显了他们在下一项大赛前的强劲状态。\n\n季军赛中，NAVI 以 2-0 战胜 BB，获得第三名。中国战队 TYLOO 最终排名第 9 至 12 位，这说明他们与国际顶尖强队之间仍有差距。\n\n接下来，各队将目光转向 BLAST Premier Rivals 香港 2026，比赛将于 11 月 11 日至 15 日举行。该赛事被视为顶尖《CS2》战队在 PGL 新加坡 Major 2026 前最后的练兵和战术测试机会。\n\n随着 Major 临近，香港站的每场比赛都至关重要。各队将力争积累势头，并解决在北京暴露出的问题，而粉丝们可以期待一场竞争激烈的赛事。", "text": "The IEM Beijing 2026 CS2 tournament ended on Sunday, with MOUZ lifting the trophy after a dominant 3-0 victory over Mongolz in the final. MOUZ did not lose a single match throughout the event, which underlines their strong form ahead of the next major competition. In the third-place match, NAVI defeated BB 2-0 to finish third. The Chinese team TYLOO ended the tournament in 9th to 12th place, which shows there is still a gap between them and the top international sides. Attention now turns to BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026, which will be held from 11 to 15 November. This event is seen as the final chance for top CS2 teams to practise and test their strategies before the PGL Major Singapore 2026. With the Major approaching, every match in Hong Kong will matter. Teams will be looking to build momentum and fix any weaknesses exposed in Beijing, while fans can expect a highly competitive tournament.", "vocab": [{"word": "sweep", "pos": "verb", "zh": "横扫", "note": "常指体育比赛中轻松取胜", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "dominant", "pos": "adj", "zh": "占优势的", "note": "形容表现强势", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "underline", "pos": "verb", "zh": "凸显", "note": "强调某事的重要性", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "momentum", "pos": "noun", "zh": "势头", "note": "build momentum 积累势头", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "trophy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖杯", "note": "lift the trophy 捧杯", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tournament", "pos": "noun", "zh": "锦标赛", "note": "体育赛事常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "final", "pos": "noun", "zh": "决赛", "note": "也可作形容词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "competition", "pos": "noun", "zh": "比赛；竞争", "note": "可指赛事或竞争", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "opponent", "pos": "noun", "zh": "对手", "note": "比赛中对阵的一方", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "strategy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "策略", "note": "复数 strategies", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "expose", "pos": "verb", 